@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
title 容器部署用例
skinparam useCaseShape rectangle

actor "用户/管理员" as UA
actor "Mock充电机" as MC

usecase "访问前端应用" as UC1
usecase "调用后端 API" as UC2
usecase "读写数据库" as UC3
usecase "调用支付模拟器" as UC4
usecase "读写 Redis 缓存" as UC5
usecase "模拟充电启停" as UC_MC

UA --> UC1
UA --> UC2
MC --> UC_MC
UC_MC --> UC2
UC1 --> UC2
UC2 --> UC3
UC2 --> UC4
UC2 --> UC5
note top of MC : Swing 桌面客户端\n模拟物理充电机前后端交互\n包含 Swing UI 组件与模拟逻辑
@enduml